d T6\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13931\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10-08-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdds supplemental regulation for Public Storage Facility\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13932\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10-08-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDistinguishes abutting conditions and incorporates additional bonus\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13937\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\/22\/2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\c9d65e2d-e16d-4fe6-a424-0e3b63f9c83c\\a245e257-5c0a-47da-ba52-35c9ca69f242\u0022\u003EArticle 1, Section 1.2\u003C\/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModifies the area median income for Workforce Housing\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13943\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-19-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\c9d65e2d-e16d-4fe6-a424-0e3b63f9c83c\\a245e257-5c0a-47da-ba52-35c9ca69f242\u0022\u003EArticle 1, Section 1.2\u003C\/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, Section 3.6.1\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERequires that 20% of new parking spaces constructed meet the EV Capable standards\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13942\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-19-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\c9d65e2d-e16d-4fe6-a424-0e3b63f9c83c\\a245e257-5c0a-47da-ba52-35c9ca69f242\u0022\u003EArticle 1, Section 1.2\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClarifies that the definition of Waterfront is for the limited purposes of the Miami 21 Code\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13944\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-19-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\c9d65e2d-e16d-4fe6-a424-0e3b63f9c83c\\a245e257-5c0a-47da-ba52-35c9ca69f242\u0022\u003EArticle 1, Section 1.2\u003C\/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESolar Equipment\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13945\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-19-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\c9d65e2d-e16d-4fe6-a424-0e3b63f9c83c\\a245e257-5c0a-47da-ba52-35c9ca69f242\u0022\u003EArticle 1, Section 1.2\u003C\/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERequires approval by additional officials for release of a unity of title, covenants and others\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13946\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-19-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, Section 5.3.4\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProvides proportional driveway width regulations in T3\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13952\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-10-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHistoric Sites or Contributing Structures\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13958\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-19-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E, Section 7.1.2.8\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExempts rezonings of properties by the City of Miami to \u0022CS\u0022 or \u0022T-1\u0022 from minimum size and frontage requirements\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13959\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-10-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E, Table 13\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApproves by Warrant Assisted Living Facilities, in the D-1\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13960\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-10-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/b820e800-81b0-4984-9884-52234b5e070f\u0022\u003EAppendix J\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAppendix J - Wynwood NRD-1\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13961\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-10-2020\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1,\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStreetscape Enhancements Throughout The City of Miami\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13804\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-13-2021\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/80117d52-4069-4169-b7c2-9cbdb12944d5\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EAppendix B\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaterfront Design Guidelines\u0022 of Miami 21 to allow flexibility for bay and river walkway design\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E9113\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14027\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E09-23-2021\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmend the definition of the term \u201cabutting\u201d as it relates to Special Area Plans\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E9382\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14034\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-08-2021\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProvides for off-site loading within an established downtown Flagler parking district area by process of waiver in certain T6 transect zones\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14041\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-09-2021\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 3, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\/cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\/8017dee8-5e8c-4d38-afd9-ea7a1c5bf855\u0022\u003ESection 3.3.3\u003C\/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\/ce42359c-c251-47bc-abc8-7a64b3b5a237\u0022\u003ESection 3.11\u003C\/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/e93fcc5e-8ae8-4b67-be05-f8fa2f11fbb6\u0022\u003EArticle 5, Section 5.5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn Ordinance Of The Miami City Commission Amending Ordinance No. 13114, the zoning ordinance of the City Of Miami, Florida, as amended; more specifically amending Article 3, Section 3.3.3, titled \u0022Waterfront Standards\u0022, Article 3, Section 3.11, titled \u0022Waterfront Standards\u0022, Article 5, Section 5.5, titled \u0022Urban Center Transect Zones (T5)\u0022, to grant flexibility regarding waterfront building setback requirements in conjunction with recent amendments to Appendix B, titled \u0022Waterfront Design Guidelines\u0022; making findings; containing a severability clause; and providing for an effective date.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10773\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=9429\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14048\u0022\u003E14048\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-10-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo prohibit gambling facilities\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=10772\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14050\u0022\u003E14050\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-10-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/69df85cc-f922-4f5f-99b1-9bb421cf5319\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EAppendix A\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo change the responsibility for reviewing and making recommendations to the Planning Director from the Urban Design Review Board to the Historic and Environmental Preservation Board.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=10770\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14051\u0022\u003E14051\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-10-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/bd8b15dc-e7db-43af-81e2-151cfe33707b\u0022\u003EAppendix C\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeight\/Number of Stories may change as permitted under Miami 21 Transect Zone if designated as a Gateway 1\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=5310\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14052\u0022\u003E14052\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-10-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1,\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo modify the definitions of attainable mixed-income housing and workforce housing, to add new incentives including a floor lot ratio bonus and new minimum unit sizes, and to permit affordable and attainable mixed-income developments abutting a T3.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=10811\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14055\u0022\u003E14055\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-30-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1,\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends the definition of the term \u201cparking, tandem\u201d and creates regulations for T5 and T6 lots with a qualified development.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10811\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13114\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E04-12-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 2, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/fc3fc636-b79e-4fed-ad68-96da69e52e78\/17b32984-57c9-4a40-a5e0-c0bba0be9b51\/5056a47b-7ab9-4d46-a399-a14fcc2056c1\/4cadd618-a94e-4486-8ec6-eec1cc86a2ac\u0022\u003ESection 2.2.1.3\u003C\/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/fc3fc636-b79e-4fed-ad68-96da69e52e78\/17b32984-57c9-4a40-a5e0-c0bba0be9b51\/6e5883fe-adaf-462a-8443-0afedb8f83d1\u0022\u003ESection 2.2.2\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClarifying that the miami 21 code provides a higher standard of zoning for those properties located in the miami-dade county Rapid Transit System Development Zone and providing that all such properties shall remain subject to all of the provisions of thhe Miami 21 Code\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E9385\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=11307\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14065\u0022\u003E14065\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E04-28-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/65be9c85-89a8-409b-ab54-049d2efbe1c9\u0022\u003EArticle 4, Table 4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn Ordinance of the Miami City Commission Amending Ordinance No. 13114, the zoning ordinance of the City of Miami, FL, as amended; more specifically by Amending Table 4, titled \u0022Density, Intensity and Parking,\u0022 to change the method by which the parking ratio may be reduced within a transit oriented development area or within a transit corridor from a waiver process to the process of an exception with city commission approval; containing a severability clause; and providing for an immediate effective date.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11307\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12009\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14083\u0022\u003E14083\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-28-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\/16cd92fd-76b0-4645-a792-4a2e984c6b6b\u0022\u003EArticle 3, Section 3.15\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn Ordinance of The Miami City Commission Amending Ordinance No. 13114, the zoning ordinance of the City Of Miami, Florida, as amended, by amending Article 3, Titled \u0022General To Zones\u0022, to establish an affordable housing transfer of development density program; containing a severability clause and providing for an effective date.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12009\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12007\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14084\u0022\u003E14084\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-28-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\/4cb3cb1b-2d87-4009-a0d2-d0b361f1fe63\/67f41265-0838-435b-854e-f3bb77f92570\u0022\u003EArticle 3, Section 3.5.2\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn Ordinance of The Miami City Commission Amending Ordinance No. 13114, the zoning ordinance of the City of Miami, Florida, as amended (\u0022 Miami 21 Zoning Code\u0022), more specifically by amending Article 3, Titled \u0022General To Zones,\u201d Section 3.5.2 as it relates to Ground Floor Height Allowances, in order To correct inconsistencies and permit additional flexibility In The design of buildings; containing a severability clause and providing for an effective date\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12007\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12217\u0026amp;highlightTerms=12217\u0022\u003E14093\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E09-13-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8d0d7fef-e5ff-43eb-802c-2c69e2024d46\u0022\u003EAppendix N\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe development of the Miami Freedom Park Special Area Plan (SAP)\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12217\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=11616\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14105\u0022\u003E14105\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-16-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6,\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/b820e800-81b0-4984-9884-52234b5e070f\u0022\u003EAppendix J\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmend Article 6 Table 13 T5 and T6, amendments throughout Appendix J\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11616\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12008\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14106\u0022\u003E14106\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E06-01-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/71f28b8f-3ff7-401b-b86f-c9a7cb354eb9\u0022\u003EAppendix E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpecial Area Plan Amendment for Brickell City Center to allow alternate building configuration\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12008\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=11824\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14110\u0022\u003E14110\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E04-06-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/8f261574-e789-4d2f-9d7e-c5e0c557eab3\u0022\u003EArticle 4, Table 12\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmend Article 4, Table 12; Design Review Criteria\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11824\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12770\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14127\u0022\u003E14127\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-17-2022\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 4, Table 4\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmend Article 4, Table 4; Standards and Tables\/Density, Intensity and Parking\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12770\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12603\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14134\u0022\u003E14134\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E01-12-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 1, titled \u0022Definitions\u0022, Article 3, Section 3.5.2, Article 5, Sections 5.4.2, 5.5.2, 5.6.2, and Appendix J\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmend the definition of Floorplates, introduce a definition for Mezzanine, amend building configuration requirements to provide flexibility in the design of the buildings within T6 Transect zones and established setback areas, and allow walkway connections between towers located within NRD-1\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12603\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12924\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14136\u0022\u003E14136\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E01-12-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\/69a6216a-0f5b-4d87-b80f-0345a450a74c\/1c3b6ebe-df1f-46cd-a164-7548dbc091dc\/7948dd02-b74a-4596-8082-96d76f5bdf49\u0022\u003EArticle 7, Section 7.1.1.4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn Ordinance Of The Miami City Commission Amending Ordinance No. 13114, The Zoning Ordinance Of The City Of Miami, Florida, As Amended (\u201cMiami 21 Code\u201d), More Specifically By Amending Article 7\/Section 7.1.1.4, Titled \u201cProcedures And Nonconformities\/Planning, Zoning And Appeals Board\u201d, To Simplify The Removal And Appointment Process For Planning, Zoning And Appeals Board Members; Containing A Severability Clause; And Providing For An Effective Date.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12924\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12840\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14149\u0022\u003E14149\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-09-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/65be9c85-89a8-409b-ab54-049d2efbe1c9\/a43cff47-923f-4983-a590-8390bcdc5c1a\u0022\u003EArticle 4, Table 4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChanges the method by which the Parking Ratio may be reduced within opportunity zones.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12840\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12918\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14147\u0022\u003E14147\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-09-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 5, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/a2ee3a8b-ac56-474c-94fe-caa10e7afa80\/50e25fa5-2052-4b25-8c01-09c8bf89b6df\u0022\u003ESection 5.9.2\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/a2ee3a8b-ac56-474c-94fe-caa10e7afa80\/50e25fa5-2052-4b25-8c01-09c8bf89b6df\u0022\u003ESection 5.9.6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModification of Regulations related to fences and walls in certain layers (Setback Areas) to clarify fence, wall, and first layer (Setback Area) frontage requirements in the D1 and D2 district zones\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12918\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12917\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14148\u0022\u003E14148\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-09-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 5, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/e93fcc5e-8ae8-4b67-be05-f8fa2f11fbb6\/93e0ad2f-7688-47cc-b133-99ce57eec9ba\u0022\u003ESection 5.5.2\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/ff51b18b-70e6-4f35-90e8-a2a6b16d2013\/b23ddfb4-6e02-4160-85c4-ef0bf0dea9e7\u0022\u003ESection 5.6.2\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModification of Regulations related to fences and walls in certain layers (Setback Areas) to allow Single-Family Homes and Two-Family Homes (Duplexes) in the applicable to fences and walls fo these uses in the \u0022T3\u0022 Transect zone.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12917\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=10771\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14154\u0022\u003E14154\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-23-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 6, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\/50ac6ec3-3bc4-4888-934e-31e59391c284\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003E6.3 Commercial Uses\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo provide clarification and additional standards regarding outdoor dining and open air retail\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10771\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12839\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14156\u0022\u003E14156\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-09-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApendix C, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/bd8b15dc-e7db-43af-81e2-151cfe33707b\/5a5c3d3f-42b5-4339-b826-2086fd000d5b\/58eb8bc9-cc79-4a8b-a024-d89b6324b69d\u0022\u003ESections 627.1.6\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/bd8b15dc-e7db-43af-81e2-151cfe33707b\/b64810d3-0e18-48a3-a03e-e1a4e7eacad0\/ca8b6c12-bc29-4e01-9c69-642ff2820710\u0022\u003E627.2.6\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/bd8b15dc-e7db-43af-81e2-151cfe33707b\/b64810d3-0e18-48a3-a03e-e1a4e7eacad0\/30ef5e7c-5c1e-4f7e-9b58-258f49e11a31\u0022\u003E627.2.7\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/bd8b15dc-e7db-43af-81e2-151cfe33707b\/b64810d3-0e18-48a3-a03e-e1a4e7eacad0\/cf285165-2e36-4416-af61-675a43f4b302\u0022\u003E627.2.12\u003C\/a\u003E,\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmendment to Building Placement and Buildable Area, Surface Parking and Parking Garages, and Table Titled Maximum Height, Build-To, Minimum Setback and Use Requirements\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12839\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12614\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14157\u0022\u003E14157\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-09-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/c057a08b-9b0e-4dc5-8792-1be7dc15fbee\/6ce4f45e-a9d8-4b6d-979b-d22830f0cbca\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\/50ac6ec3-3bc4-4888-934e-31e59391c284\/04988ddc-fa56-415a-9cd2-b67f9b132c22\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/69df85cc-f922-4f5f-99b1-9bb421cf5319\/f52e59d2-8e32-4a67-8b0d-0fcf41ca42f5\/2ce0e10f-ae7f-480d-b4ff-051bcc72adae\/74583c61-42c3-430d-a5dc-1dea4e5bada8\u0022\u003EApendix A\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo replace or strike references to the Neighborhood Enhancement Team (\u0022NET\u0022)\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12614\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13315\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14158\u0022\u003E14158\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-09-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 6, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\/727b481b-6ce7-46ac-bd94-4f40708a84b4\/bb5f4d6d-80a3-4268-b62e-30774dd73f96\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003ESection 6.1 Table 13\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo modify Table 13 to allow for additional height to fences and walls enclosing infrastructure and utilities\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13315\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13318\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14159\u0022\u003E14159\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-09-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 5, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/9be43f09-4afe-48fa-811c-ce0842dcc613\/f35f7e77-9f2a-4747-b34a-0aca398c5824\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003ESection 5.3.4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo modify and simplify regulations related to driveways in the T3 Transect Zone\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13318\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13453\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14162\u0022\u003E14162\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4-13-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 5, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/9de8d35c-7cfe-4d61-aa44-47b2ad1f79e8\/168c4063-5eb1-4d96-8cc5-3c69f52bb31f\u0022\u003ESection 5.4.2\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/e93fcc5e-8ae8-4b67-be05-f8fa2f11fbb6\/93e0ad2f-7688-47cc-b133-99ce57eec9ba\u0022\u003E5.5.2\u003C\/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/ff51b18b-70e6-4f35-90e8-a2a6b16d2013\/b23ddfb4-6e02-4160-85c4-ef0bf0dea9e7\u0022\u003E5.6.2\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo modify the regulations for access points along frontages in \u0022T4\u0022 General Urban Transect Zones, \u0022T5\u0022 Urban Center Transect Zones, and \u0022T6\u0022 Urban Core Transect Zones.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13453\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13540\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14167\u0022\u003E14167\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E04-27-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 5, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/ff51b18b-70e6-4f35-90e8-a2a6b16d2013\/b23ddfb4-6e02-4160-85c4-ef0bf0dea9e7\u0022\u003ESection 5.6.2\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo allow additional felxibilities in office and commercial floorplate above the eight floor.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13540\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12838\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14177\u0022\u003E14177\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E05-25-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 7, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\/69a6216a-0f5b-4d87-b80f-0345a450a74c\/35580ac1-8d8f-467c-815a-7b58076307ff\/8a81825f-dbc8-4181-8ff9-c9ea068f8973\u0022\u003ESection 7.1.2.1\u003C\/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\/69a6216a-0f5b-4d87-b80f-0345a450a74c\/c977c089-3577-4be4-9baf-0155cbed95d3\/a10fb99a-d312-4eb3-83e8-c595fd35efe9\u0022\u003E7.1.3.7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo provide the issuance of the Certificates of Use in certain limited instances where a property or building on a property is subject to pending code compliance or building violations.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12838\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13539\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14178\u0022\u003E14178\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E05-25-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 7, \u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\/69a6216a-0f5b-4d87-b80f-0345a450a74c\/c977c089-3577-4be4-9baf-0155cbed95d3\/a10fb99a-d312-4eb3-83e8-c595fd35efe9\u0022\u003ESection 7.1.3.7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo provide clarification on circumstances in which an application shall not be scheduled for a public hearing nor any approvals be issued by the City of Miami (\u0022CITY\u0022) if the property subject to the hearing or request has open vilolation(s) and\/or owes monies to the City and to provide consistency with section 2-208 of the code of the City of Miami, Florida.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13539\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12861\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14179\u0022\u003E14179\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E05-25-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 5, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/e93fcc5e-8ae8-4b67-be05-f8fa2f11fbb6\/fcef9bd1-cb08-4e2a-974b-91328af767fa\u0022\u003ESection 5.5.1\u003C\/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/ff51b18b-70e6-4f35-90e8-a2a6b16d2013\/85aa74f4-0ae1-41c7-b4ce-abe3d2942cae\u0022\u003E5.6.1\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo clarify the location and design of cross-Block Passage and, in specified circumstances, allow for enhanced design elements to be provided in Lieu of cross-Block Passage.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12861\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13541\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14183\u0022\u003E14183\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E06-08-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 1, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/c057a08b-9b0e-4dc5-8792-1be7dc15fbee\/6ce4f45e-a9d8-4b6d-979b-d22830f0cbca\u0022\u003ESection 1.1\u003C\/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/c057a08b-9b0e-4dc5-8792-1be7dc15fbee\/9fe21dbf-4406-4285-9a53-7d21f70f4cce\u0022\u003ESection 1.2\u003C\/a\u003E, Article 3, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\/771f7344-f452-4dce-9310-503a1d60326f\u0022\u003ESection 3.4\u003C\/a\u003E, Article 4, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/42aa97cf-33d8-412a-80b6-8ad4cc5a5990\u0022\u003ETable 3\u003C\/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/65be9c85-89a8-409b-ab54-049d2efbe1c9\u0022\u003ETable 4\u003C\/a\u003E, Article 6, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003ETable 13\u003C\/a\u003E, and Article 7, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\/f8407b08-4f63-4a43-945f-17f215cc845a\u0022\u003ESection 7.2\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo allow and establish definitions and regulations for Co-Living Residential Uses.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13541\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13775\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14188\u0022\u003E14188\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E06-22-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 4, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/42aa97cf-33d8-412a-80b6-8ad4cc5a5990\u0022\u003ETable 3\u003C\/a\u003E, and Article 6, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\/50ac6ec3-3bc4-4888-934e-31e59391c284\/a13d2a82-215d-479d-83c5-8a61c46b8b5f\u0022\u003ESection 6.3.7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo allow educational uses by right in the T6 transect zone in certain circumstances.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13775\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13935\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14191\u0022\u003E14191\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-24-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/45c6409a-f873-4f7b-8d99-eb443578ac58\/9b2d1434-8f20-4478-93e3-739cc9ec6045\u0022\u003EAppendix D, Section 3\u003C\/a\u003E(c)\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn ordinance of the Miami City Commission amending ordinance No. 1311, the zoning ordinance of the City of Miami, Florida, as amended, by amending Appendix D, titled SD-16.3 Miami Worldcenter, Section 3(c), to allow certain design standard flexibility to promote net-zero building performance requirments; containing a severability clause; and providing for an effective date.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13935\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=13627\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14200\u0022\u003E14200\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-27-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 1, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, Article 8, and Article 9.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe changes clarify and introduce new frontage-related definitions, illustrations, modify T5 and T6 height requirements and add tree placement flexibility.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E13627\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14112\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14210\u0022\u003E14210\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E09-28-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIt allows structures containing a nonconforming use to resume such use when the owner complies with the timeframes in the structure order.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14112\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14113\u0026amp;highlightTerms=Zoning%20Text%20-%20T5%20Bonus%20Height\u0022\u003E14211\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E09-28-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends Article 3 and 5 clarifying density standards in certain transit locations, and allowing bonus building height and modifications to the development standards in specified areas within the T5 urban center.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14113\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14503\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14212\u0022\u003E14212\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E09-28-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo permit city of Miami owned or city-funded affordable homeownership located in the T4 or T5 to utilize the development standards of the T3 transect zone.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14503\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14558\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14226\u0022\u003E14226\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10-26-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 3, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\/ce42359c-c251-47bc-abc8-7a64b3b5a237\u0022\u003ESection 3.11\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends maximum lot area for developments within the Southeast Overtown Park West Community Redevelopment Agency\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14558\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14631\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14228\u0022\u003E14228\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10-26-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIncorporates additional height allowances and freeboard in the floodplain.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14631\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14195\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14234\u0022\u003E14234\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-16-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESections \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/9be43f09-4afe-48fa-811c-ce0842dcc613\/6899f306-a431-4660-af4f-f25cb643b6ba\u0022\u003E5.3.1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\/69a6216a-0f5b-4d87-b80f-0345a450a74c\/35580ac1-8d8f-467c-815a-7b58076307ff\/cd102f37-6574-48c0-9595-fac57e666de6\u0022\u003E7.1.2.5\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\/f8407b08-4f63-4a43-945f-17f215cc845a\/1e445b4e-874e-4388-b9b9-7b2d2bd7e7f6\u0022\u003E7.2.3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo clarify and amend the Waiver process relating to alterations to nonconforming residences.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14195\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14196\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14235\u0022\u003E14235\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-16-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdd new definition (Article 1); clarify the Waiver processes relating to elderly housing (Article 3); clarify Waiver processes relating to substitution of loading berths (Article 4); clarify the Waiver processes relating to service and parking access from a Principal Frontage (Article 5); clarify the Waiver processes relating to reservoir parking spaces (Article 6); clarify the Waiver processes relating to nonconforming properties and update the Waivers summary list (Article 7).\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14196\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14202\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14236\u0022\u003E14236\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-16-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntroduces a flexible lot coverage program, clarifies the application of Waivers, and amends the 10% Waiver.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14202\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14679\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14237\u0022\u003E14237\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-16-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClarifies the minor modification allowance of a footprint of a building\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14679\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14682\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14238\u0022\u003E14238\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-16-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmending Article 4, Table 3 to permit Civic Community Facility uses in \u201cT4-R\u201d; further amending Article 6, Section 6.1 to provide supplementary regulations for Community Facilities in table 13\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14682\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14680\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14241\u0022\u003E14241\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11\/29\/2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\/cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\/96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003ESection 3.3.6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModifies the Brickell Financial setback area\u0027s Established Setback standards and add a new Downtown East Flagler setback area.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14680\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14890\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14243\u0022\u003E14243\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-06-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/b820e800-81b0-4984-9884-52234b5e070f\u0022\u003EAppendix J\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends Sec.3.2.2, 3.5.2, 4, 5.1(e), 5.2(d)\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14890\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14889\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14242\u0022\u003E14242\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-27-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/b820e800-81b0-4984-9884-52234b5e070f\u0022\u003EAppendix J\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/1b0e4548-4ad5-4097-b361-f38f7b3475b8\u0022\u003EAppendix P\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends Green Roof definition; introduce Intermediate Level definition; clarify application of Intermediate Level; and amends Article 5, Appendix J, Appendix P, to clarify configuration standards for rooftop elements\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14889\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14672\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14672\u0022\u003E14244\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-14-2023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/e42977f6-aa97-42b1-b1be-c8fa10c682b0\u0022\u003EAppendix F\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5th Amendment to MDD Retail Street SAP to add additional properties\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14672\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14192\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14250\u0022\u003E14250\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E01-11-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdds definition, clarifies and amend the waiver processes, and updates the waivers summary list\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14192\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=15125\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14251\u0022\u003E14251\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E01-11-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/beec151a-cab0-429f-a02d-daf17cd14cc7\u0022\u003EArticle 10\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAllows for fences and walls in the first layer for uses that solely serve the needs of neighborhood children.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E15125\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=12860\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14261\u0022\u003E14261\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-14-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/69df85cc-f922-4f5f-99b1-9bb421cf5319\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EAppendix A\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo modify the existing mixed use cultural district boundary, create new uses definitions, introduce development and parking flexibilities, and create new regulations and development guidelines for affordable housing\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12860\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=15047\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14262\u0022\u003E14262\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-14-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo allow bonus building height in certain Opportunity Zones within T5\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E15047\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=15942\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14288\u0022\u003E14288\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E05-23-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElderly Housing Density Bonus\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E15942\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=14197\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14302\u0022\u003E14302\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-25-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/69df85cc-f922-4f5f-99b1-9bb421cf5319\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EAppendix A\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIt updates the waivers summary list, and modifies the requirements for proposed demolitions\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14197\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=16173\u0026amp;highlightTerms=T3-O%20Density%20Calculation\u0022\u003E14306\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E09-30-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticle 4, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/42aa97cf-33d8-412a-80b6-8ad4cc5a5990\u0022\u003ETable 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\/65be9c85-89a8-409b-ab54-049d2efbe1c9\/ecf4a247-beb9-42f7-a82a-36c4fd45932a\u0022\u003ETable 4\u003C\/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAllows two dwelling units on a legal nonconforming substandard lot zoned T3-O\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16173\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=16029\u0026amp;highlightTerms=Bed%20Breakfast\u0022\u003E14315\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E09-26-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnly allow bed and breakfast use in T4-R under certain circumstances\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16029\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=16030\u0026amp;highlightTerms=Side%20and%20or%20Rear%20Setback%20Encroachments\u0022\u003E14316\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10-02-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo clarify side and rear setback encroachments and any associated design requirements for T5, T6, and CI-HD\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16030\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=16224\u0026amp;highlightTerms=TDD%20Opportunity%20Zones\u0022\u003E14328\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10-24-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo expand the affordable housing transfer of development density program to include opportunity zones and to provide other minor clarifications.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16224\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=16432\u0026amp;highlightTerms=Fences%20and%20Walls%20-%20Enclosing%20Game%20Courts%20and%20Infrastructure%20and%20Utilities\u0022\u003E14329\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-04-24\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntroduces a definition for game courts, allows additional fence and wall height necessary to enclose outdoor leisure activities, and amends the maximum height for walls and fences relating to infrastructure and utilities uses.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16432\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=16789\u0026amp;highlightTerms=16789\u0022\u003E14249\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-12-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHarmonize the Public Notice requirements for Planning and Zoning matters to the language found Chapter 62 of the code of the City of Miami\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16789\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=16433\u0026amp;highlightTerms=By-Right%20Administrative%20Site%20Plan%20Review%20Process\u0022\u003E14336\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-21-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStreamlines development approvals by introducing an administrative site plan review, simplifying permit processes, extending approval timelines, revising phased project rules, clarifying waiver restrictions, and applying changes to previously approved applications, with immediate effect.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16433\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3567\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=16687\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14341\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-12-2024\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPermit recreational facility uses and certain community facility uses in \u201cCS\u201d Civic Space Transect Zones by right.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16687\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3567\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=16917\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14350\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E01-09-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmending Section 3.4, to clarify density standards in certain Transit Corridors, and by amending Section 3.14, and illustration 5.5, to allow Bonus Building Height within specified Transit Corridors and Transect zones in exchange for Affordable\/workforce Housing.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16917\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3837\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=14139\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14355\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-13-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAllows the utilization of Public Right-of-Way dedications since the last recorded plat for Density and Intensity purposes\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14139\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3837\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=16869\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14354\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E02-13-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size:11.0pt\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0027font-family:\u0022Arial\u0022,sans-serif\u0027\u003EAddition of a Portico definition; increase Driveway design options; clarifications of the maximum Height of ground-floor Story and raised decks within T3; clarify the Freeboard regulations within the T3; additional detail and the reformatting of language regarding Height and disposition of Fences and walls in T3; flexibility relating to parking within the T3; flexibility provided to Encroachments to the rear of T3; and Waiver to allow additional height for raised decks.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16869\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3839\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=16955\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14360\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E03-13-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo allow the reestablishment of specific-purpose structures, either designated historic sites or over 50 years old, for their original uses through a warrant or exception process.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16955\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3842\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17023\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14365\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E04-24-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/1b0e4548-4ad5-4097-b361-f38f7b3475b8\u0022\u003EAppendix P\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDemolition, parking, and design standards updated.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17023\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=4129\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17440\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14373\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E06-17-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProhibits properties within or abutting the Coconut Grove Conservation District (NCD-3) from using the T5-O bonus height under the Public Benefits Program.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17440\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=4129\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17163\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14374\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E06-17-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAllows existing nonconforming public storage facilities in T5\/T6 zones to extensively repair, remodel, or alter structures if they meet design criteria and get approval.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17163\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=4129\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17018\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14375\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10-01-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/69df85cc-f922-4f5f-99b1-9bb421cf5319\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EAppendix A\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpdates definitions and regulations for Ancillary Dwelling Units, including design standards, allowable zones, parking, unit sizes, and waiver processes, and clarify related rules and illustrations.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17018\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3847\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17596\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14378\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-10-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpdates criteria for denying or revoking a Certificate of Use.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17596\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3847\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17531\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14379\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7-10-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends zoning ordinance to update definitions, parking standards, design criteria, and housing regulations. Includes clarifications, incentives, and procedural consistency.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17531\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3847\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17385\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14380\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E07-10-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EException added to zoning rules allowing development-related zoning applications by the City of Miami despite code violations.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17385\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3847\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17383\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14381\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7-10-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/b820e800-81b0-4984-9884-52234b5e070f\u0022\u003EAppendix J\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpdates to allow bonus height, clarify parking and art requirements, adjust standards for lodging uses, revise landscaping in parking lots, and add setback rules for key corridors.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17383\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3848\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17599\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14385\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7-24-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpdates Article 3 to add Section 3.19 (Transit Station Neighborhood Development) establishing criteria for transit-oriented development with design flexibility and public benefits.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17599\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=17653\u0026amp;highlightTerms=17653\u0022\u003E14387\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7-24-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAppendix Q\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe ordinance establishes the Braman Miami Campus Special Area Plan, rezoning specific properties to allow for customized development and auto-related commercial use.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17653\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3848\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17651\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14389\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7-24-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe ordinance updates to expand flexibility in T4 zones and adjust rules for food service, lot coverage, building size, roof design, and setbacks.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17651\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3849\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=17323\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14394\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E9-11-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis ordinance amends the City of Miami\u2019s zoning code to establish a new Workforce Housing Program that provides supplemental regulations to support the development of housing for middle-income workers.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17323\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=17618\u0026amp;highlightTerms=17618\u0022\u003E14416\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-20-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAppendix R\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmendment to ECORESILIENCY SAP (former Jungle Island ) to allow for mixed use residential development and rezoning to T6-36 with a maximum height of 48 stories on T6 zoned parcel and new public park on CS zoned parcel.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17618\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18107\u0026amp;highlightTerms=18107\u0022\u003E14420\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-20-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe ordinance allows fishing equipment and supply storage on designated working waterfront properties.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18107\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=17649\u0026amp;highlightTerms=17649\u0022\u003E14421\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11-20-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends Miami 21 Code to update educational uses and allow development capacity incentives for educational facilities.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18179\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3856\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=18178\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14426\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-11-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends to permit limited commercial uses in certain restricted transect zones by revising the affordable, attainable, and workforce housing program sections\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18178\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3856\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=18179\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14427\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-11-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends to clarify parking rules for micro dwelling units, and allows micro dwelling units by right in specified areas.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18179\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=3856\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=18180\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14428\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12-11-2025\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/081c7bc5-1ede-4469-9754-b6706daa4489\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 7\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends the code to establish a reasonable accommodation(s) procedure for land use regulations.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18180\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=4135\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=18388\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14437\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E01-08-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmends density, intensity, and parking standards in T4, T5, and T6 zones.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18388\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18258\u0026amp;highlightTerms=14436\u0022\u003E14436\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1-08-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\c9d65e2d-e16d-4fe6-a424-0e3b63f9c83c\\a245e257-5c0a-47da-ba52-35c9ca69f242\u0022\u003EArticle 1, Section 1.2\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpdates Article 1 and 6 to clarify personal wireless service facilities (PWSF), streamline PWSF approval\/entitlement processes, and update related design criteria.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18258\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18259\u0026amp;highlightTerms=18259\u0022\u003E14440\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1-22-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpdates Article 3 Sections 3.9 and 3.14 to clarify special area plan (SAP) public benefit requirements and how SAP public benefits are calculated.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18259\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=\u0026amp;MeetingID=4140\u0026amp;MediaPosition=\u0026amp;ID=18014\u0026amp;CssClass=\u0022\u003E14446\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2-26-2026  \u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIt refines regulations and simplifies the process for auto-related commercial uses.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18014\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18846\u0026amp;highlightTerms=18846\u0022\u003E14452\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3-12-2026  \u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/1b0e4548-4ad5-4097-b361-f38f7b3475b8\u0022\u003EAppendix P\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModifies building placement, height, signage, and street design standards in Wynwood Norte.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18846\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18487\u0026amp;highlightTerms=18487\u0022\u003E14457\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4-23-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/413cd52e-98d0-40c0-b946-a16d4d84c0c6\u0022\u003EArticle 6\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpdates definitions, use tables, parking requirements, and supplemental regulations for adult daycare facilities.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18487\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18479\u0026amp;highlightTerms=18479\u0022\u003E14458\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4-23-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArticles 1, 3, and 6\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUpdates vessel-related definitions, parking standards, and supplemental regulations for boat slips, boat houses, docks\/piers, and marine-related commercial uses.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18479\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18838\u0026amp;highlightTerms=18838\u0022\u003E14470\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5-28-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModifies the  affordable and attainable mixed-income transfer of development density program.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18838\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=19110\u0026amp;highlightTerms=19110\u0022\u003E14471\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5-28-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETo allow T3 development standards for single-family and duplex construction in higher transect zones.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E19110\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=19229\u0026amp;highlightTerms=19229\u0022\u003E144475\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6-25-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAn ordinance to clarify when lots may meet an exemption from lot size restrictions.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E19229\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=18845\u0026amp;highlightTerms=18845\u0022\u003E14483\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7-24-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\\cd9d9570-550f-47be-b530-33c1d29c4db3\\cf053535-9dc9-460b-b403-eb0c43c9f517\\96f48ebd-8f69-4661-9645-96302a8e2f37\u0022\u003EArticle 3\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/cc66de11-c6ed-4007-a7b8-3a10fbb320c6\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 4\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDefines and clarify greenways, create a greenway public benefits program, establish development standards for sites fronting greenways, and clarify the greenway civic space type.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E18845\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/miamifl.iqm2.com\/Citizens\/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?ID=19427\u0026amp;highlightTerms=19427\u0022\u003E14484\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7-28-2026\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/f98538cb-0afe-41d0-827c-a581ff0c179a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 1\u003C\/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/us\/fl\/miami#\/8ba0388c-fe18-4395-92f3-1838d1a3ff08\/25a88917-341c-43ec-882c-ac2669df805a\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EArticle 5\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDefine cottage housing, revise lot coverage, allow cottage housing in T3-O zones and on nonconforming T3 lots.\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E19427\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003C\/tbody\u003E\u003C\/table\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size:28px\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022color:#000000\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAccessibility: \u003C\/strong\u003EIf you experience any difficulty accessing the information on our website, \u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/gridics.com\/contact\/\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022color:#2980b9\u0022\u003Eplease email us with details of the issue\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022color:#000000\u0022\u003E.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C!-- page break --\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"51a05ccc-a0ff-4b0f-8c09-4d1cc30f0f95","prev_id":null}]}]